			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 4000
			},
			"text": "你已經學了13課,但每一課都是拆開獎的。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:04,000",
				"to": "00:00:07,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 4000,
				"to": 7100
			},
			"text": "如果把他們拼起來,會得到什麼?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:07,100",
				"to": "00:00:12,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 7100,
				"to": 12300
			},
			"text": "一個能在筆記本上10分鐘訓完,還會寫沙士比亞的模型。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,300",
				"to": "00:00:17,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12300,
				"to": 17000
			},
			"text": "階段期,第14課,從零構建一個Transformer。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,000",
				"to": "00:00:21,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17000,
				"to": 21300
			},
			"text": "這是整個階段的收官項目,也叫Nano GPT。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,300",
				"to": "00:00:24,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21300,
				"to": 24900
			},
			"text": "它不原創,但每個人都該至少寫一遍。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,900",
				"to": "00:00:29,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24900,
				"to": 29000
			},
			"text": "輸入是Token,先過詞嵌入,和位置嵌入。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,000",
				"to": "00:00:35,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29000,
				"to": 35100
			},
			"text": "然後堆L個Block,每個Block是規劃、注意力、殘差、前繪。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:35,100",
				"to": "00:00:40,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 35100,
				"to": 40600
			},
			"text": "最後,接一個和嵌入共享權重的輸出頭,得到每個詞的概率。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:40,600",
				"to": "00:00:47,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 40600,
				"to": 47200
			},
			"text": "注意力來自第3課,多頭拆分來自第10課,因果研碼來自第7課。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,200",
				"to": "00:00:52,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47200,
				"to": 52200
			},
			"text": "規劃和前繪來自第5課,位置編碼來自第4課。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,200",
				"to": "00:00:55,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52200,
				"to": 55600
			},
			"text": "13課的內容,在這裡全部接上。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:55,600",
				"to": "00:00:59,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 55600,
				"to": 59200
			},
			"text": "語料是Tiny Shakespeare,大約一兆文本。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,200",
				"to": "00:01:03,400"
